---
// pages/cancellation-policy.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
const lastUpdated = '1 August 2025';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={`Cancellation Policy | ${SITE.name}`}
  description="Cancellation policy for The Man Wanders Globe — tiered cancellation windows, fees, and process for modifying or cancelling your travel booking."
>
  <div class="pt-32 pb-12 bg-[var(--color-accent-secondary)]">
    <div class="container-site">
      <span class="text-eyebrow block mb-4">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="text-display-lg text-white mb-3">Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-body text-white/60">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section-padding bg-[var(--color-bg)]">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl space-y-10">

      <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5 text-sm text-amber-800">
        <strong>⚠️ Client review required:</strong> Confirm the cancellation windows, fee percentages, and any supplier-specific non-refundable components before publishing. These are standard draft terms only.
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-4">Cancellation by You (the Traveller)</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Cancellations must be submitted to us in writing (email or WhatsApp message) and are effective from the date of written confirmation by our team. The following cancellation schedule applies to most packages. Specific non-refundable supplier terms (e.g. certain airlines, peak-season hotels, and cruise bookings) will be communicated in your booking confirmation and may override this schedule.
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-[var(--color-accent-secondary)] text-white">
                <th class="p-4 text-left">Days Before Departure</th>
                <th class="p-4 text-left">Cancellation Charge</th>
                <th class="p-4 text-left">Refund</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-[var(--color-border)]">
              {[
                ['60 days or more', 'Processing fee only (₹2,000–₹5,000 per person)', 'Full deposit minus processing fee'],
                ['45–59 days', '25% of total package cost', '75% refund of total paid'],
                ['30–44 days', '40% of total package cost', '60% refund of total paid'],
                ['15–29 days', '60% of total package cost', '40% refund of total paid'],
                ['8–14 days', '80% of total package cost', '20% refund of total paid'],
                ['0–7 days / No show', '100% of total package cost', 'No refund'],
              ].map(([window, charge, refund]) => (
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-4 font-medium text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">{window}</td>
                  <td class="p-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">{charge}</td>
                  <td class="p-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">{refund}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="text-caption text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] mt-3 italic">
          Note: Processing fees cover administrative, bank transfer, and supplier-communication costs. Supplier non-refundable components (airfare, visa fees, specific hotel bookings) will be deducted prior to calculating the above percentages.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-4">How to Cancel</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-3 text-body text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] list-decimal list-inside leading-relaxed">
          <li>Email us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contact.email}`} class="text-[var(--color-accent)] animated-underline">{SITE.contact.email}</a> with your booking reference, full name, and the reason for cancellation.</li>
          <li>Our team will acknowledge receipt within 4 business hours and confirm the applicable cancellation fee.</li>
          <li>Any eligible refund will be processed within 10–14 business days to your original payment method (subject to bank processing times).</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-4">Modifications (Date Changes, Amendments)</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          Modifications to confirmed bookings (date changes, destination amendments, traveller additions) are subject to supplier availability and may incur amendment fees charged by hotels, airlines, and other suppliers. We will communicate any charges to you before processing changes. Amendments requested within 14 days of departure may be treated as a cancellation and re-booking.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-4">Cancellation by Us</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          We reserve the right to cancel a booking in exceptional circumstances including (but not limited to):
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-body text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] list-disc list-inside leading-relaxed">
          <li>Force majeure events: natural disasters, war, civil unrest, pandemics, or government travel bans</li>
          <li>Minimum group size not met (for group packages — minimum size communicated at booking)</li>
          <li>Non-payment of balance by the due date</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-body text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mt-3">
          In the event we cancel, we will offer you: (a) an alternative package of equivalent or greater value; (b) a credit voucher valid for 24 months; or (c) a full refund of all amounts paid to us (excluding non-recoverable third-party costs where applicable). We will not be liable for any additional costs you may incur (e.g. flights or accommodation booked independently).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-4">Travel Insurance</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          We strongly recommend purchasing comprehensive travel insurance including trip cancellation cover at the time of booking. Many cancellation scenarios (illness, bereavement, adverse weather) may be covered by your insurer, reducing your financial exposure under this policy.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
